// CSD-Bridge: the layers on the layer wheel (AILAYERWHEEL).
//
// With nothing selected, picking a layer on the wheel makes it the current layer. With
// objects selected, it moves them to that layer. AILAYERWHEELSETUP ticks layers on and off
// and writes this file; it can also be edited by hand.
//
// "layers" holds full layer names, in the order they go round the wheel (clockwise from
// the top). The words in front of the dash make the rings: "AE CIV PLN - KERB NEW" sits
// under AE, then CIV, then PLN. A ring with only one choice is folded into the middle.
// Layers a drawing doesn't have are shown greyed out, so every layer keeps its place.
//
// To share one file across the office, put it on a network drive and set
// "layer_wheel_file" in %APPDATA%\CsdBridge\settings.json on each PC (the setup window's
// "Change file" button does this).
